promise_out_of_array.vlt:10:30: error: cannot read a `Promise<string>` out of an array element
  = note: TypeScript allows this, but a Velt promise has one owner (`await` takes its result) and can't be copied or shared: take it out of the array with `pop()` or `splice(i, 1)`, or await the promises together with `Promise.all(arr)`
